{
  "workflowId": "300000318559902",
  "workflowCode": "ORA_TIME_ASSISTANT",
  "name": "Time Assistant",
  "description": "This workflow agent processes uploaded, signed time sheet document, generates corresponding digital time card, saves and provides a summary.",
  "specification": {
    "jsonSchemaName": "Workflow.spec",
    "jsonSchemaVersion": "1",
    "inputs": [],
    "outputSpecification": " ",
    "agentsValueMappings": [],
    "dataPipeline": {
      "pipelineNodes": [
        {
          "metadata": {
            "description": "Start of data pipeline",
            "name": "Start"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1756778233976"
          },
          "code": "START",
          "id": "start",
          "inputs": [],
          "type": "START"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "errorNodeId": "1756791072326",
            "name": "Understand User Prompt"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1768897955029"
          },
          "code": "UNDERSTAND_USER_PROMPT",
          "id": "1756778233976",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1756778233977_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "# Role\nYou are an intelligent agent. Your job is to process uploaded time sheet document and prepare timecard.\n\n# Constraints\n- Do not use outside knowledge.\n- Do not generate, guess, or assume missing information.\n- Only use what is explicitly written in the user’s input.\n- Ignore chat history — treat every request as new.\n- Always rerun these instructions fresh for each interaction.\n\n# Input\n`{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}`\n\n# steps\n## when `{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}`\n### is close matach to one of the following: **FlowName** <- \"TIME_SHEET\"\n  - Create timecard for uploaded time sheet document.\n  - Generate timecard for uploaded time sheet document.\n  - Prepare timecard for uploaded time sheet document.\n  - Process uploaded time sheet document and prepare timecard.\n  - Process uploaded time sheet document and generate timecard.\n  - Process uploaded time sheet document.\n  - Process time sheet document.\n  - Process time sheet document and update time card.\n  - Process time sheet document and append time entries from time sheet document to time card.\n  - Process time sheet file and prepare time card.\n\n### is close match to one of the following: **FlowName** <- \"HELP\"\n  - Help\n  - What are the features supported\n  - Provide help\n  - What can you do\n  - What are your responsibilities.\n\n### otherwise: **FlowName** <- \"INVALID\"\n\n\n# Notes for the end user\n## How to Upload Your Timesheet Document:\n- Use Time Assistant Agent chat window file upload feature.\n- Time sheet document file with csv format is supported.\n- Please note: Only one time card will be processed at a time.\n##  Important:\n- This agent can generate a new time card or add time entries from your uploaded CSV timesheet documnet file.\n- Updating of time entries from an existing time card is not supported.\n- Deleting of time entries from an existed time card is not supported.\n\n\n## CSV Template Sample\nEmployee Number : 955160008186755\nTime Period :  9/1/25  -  9/7//25\nDate       | Assignment                  | Time Type | Start        | Stop\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n9/1/25  | E955160008185297 | Regular     | 9:00 AM  |  5:00 PM"
            },
            {
              "id": "1756778233977_2",
              "name": "temperature",
              "type": "number",
              "value": "0.2"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"FlowName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Check flow"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "TIME_SHEET": "1773585511773",
            "INVALID": "1768898030289",
            "HELP": "1768898768556"
          },
          "code": "CHECK_FLOW",
          "convergenceTargetId": "end",
          "id": "1768897955029",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1768897955031_1",
              "name": "caseExpression",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.UNDERSTAND_USER_PROMPT.$output.FlowName}}"
