              "name": "returnValue",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "**Error**: \"I'm sorry, but I'm unable to assist with prompt:  {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}} \"\n\n<br>\n<br>\n<b>Please try with the following prompts.</b>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Process uploaded time sheet document and prepare time card.</li>\n<ul>"
            }
          ],
          "type": "RETURN"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Show Help"
          },
          "outcomes": {},
          "code": "SHOW_HELP",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1773585511773",
          "id": "1768898768556",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1768898768557_1",
              "name": "returnValue",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "<p> I am Time Assistant. My responsibilities are as follows. </p>\n\n<ul>\n<li> To process uploaded time sheet document and prepare time card.</li>\n\n<p>\n<i>How to Upload Your Timesheet Document</i>\n<ul>\n    <li> Use Time Assistant Agent chat window document or file upload feature.</li>\n    <li> Time sheet document supported file with csv format is supported.</li>\n    <li> Please note: Only one time card will be processed at a time.</li>\n</ul>\n<i>Important</i>\n    <ul>\n        <li> I can generate a new time card or add time entries from your uploaded CSV timesheet documnet file.</li>\n        <li> Updating of time entries from an existing time card is not supported.</li>\n        <li> Deleting of time entries from an existed time card is not supported.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n<i>CSV Template Example</i>\nEmployee Number : 955160008186755\nTime Period :  9/1/25  -  9/7//25\nDate       | Assignment       | Time Type    | Start        | Stop\n<hr>\n9/1/25  | E955160008185297 | Regular     | 9:00 AM      |  5:00 PM\n</p>\n</ul>"
            }
          ],
          "type": "RETURN"
        },
