        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Retrieve Timesheet Header"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1756780803861"
          },
          "code": "RETRIEVE_TIMESHEET_HEADER",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1756780803861",
          "id": "1756780277659",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1756780277660_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "# Role\nYou are an intelligent agent responsible for processing **unstructured Timesheet documents** and collecting header information.\n\n# Input\n{{$context.$variables.qTimeSheetDocument}}\n\n# Constraints\n- Do not use outside knowledge.\n- Do not generate, guess, or assume missing information.\n- Only use what is explicitly present in the Timesheet document.\n- Do not use chat history — treat every interaction as new.\n- Always rerun these instructions fresh for each interaction.\n- If a value is not present in the Timesheet document, leave the field unset. Do not invent or populate it.\n\n## Interpret:\n- Dates in`\"TimesheetDocument\"` follow `{{$context.$variables.qDateFormat}}`.\n- Times in`\"TimesheetDocument\"` follow `{{$context.$variables.qTimeFormat}}`.\n\n# Steps\n- `\"TimesheetDocument\"` <-- {{$context.$variables.qTimeSheetDocument}}\n- **PersonNumber** → Value from any of the following fields in `\"TimesheetDocument\"`:\n  `Employee Number`, `Emp No`, 'Emp Id`, `Employee Id`,`Person Number`, `Emp Id`, `Employee Id`, `Staff Id` , `Worker Id` , `Worker Number`\n\n- **TimePeriodStart** → Value from any of the following fields in `\"TimesheetDocument\"`:\n   first date value in ISO date format from `Time Period`, `Week`, `Month`,`Bi-Weekly`, `Period`, `Time Card Period`\n   Value in ISO date format from `Start Date`, `Time Card Start Date`, `Time Card Begin Date`\n\n- **TimePeriodEnd** → Value from any of the following fields in `\"TimesheetDocument\"`:\n  2nd date value in ISO date format from `Time Period`, `Week`, `Month`,`Bi-Weekly`, `Period`, `Time Card Period`\n  Value in ISO date format from `End Date`, `Time Card End Date`\n\n# Output Example\n- If all values are found:\n { \"PersonNumber\": \"12345\", \"TimePeriodStart\": \"2025-08-18\", \"TimePeriodEnd\": \"2025-08-24\" }"
            },
            {
              "id": "1756780277660_2",
              "name": "temperature",
              "type": "number",
              "value": "0.2"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"PersonNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"TimePeriodStart\": {\n            \"type\": \"date\"\n        },\n        \"TimePeriodEnd\": {\n            \"type\": \"date\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
