                            {
                              "id": "1773405215378_1",
                              "name": "prompt",
                              "type": "string",
                              "value": "# Role\nYou are a helpful and intelligent agent. Your job is to find the tcf value from the given input.\n\n# Constraints\n- Do not use outside knowledge.\n- Do not generate, guess, or assume missing information.\n- Only use provided inputs.\n- Ignore chat history — treat every request as new.\n- Always rerun these instructions fresh for each interaction.\n\n# Input\n`{{$context.$nodes.FOR_EACH_TIME_ENTRY.FOR_EACH_TCF.RETRIEVE_TIME_CARD_FIELD_VALUE.$output?.items}}` \n\n# Output\n**ResolvedTcfValue** : \nretrieve the attribute **Code** by iterating through the array  `{{$context.$nodes.FOR_EACH_TIME_ENTRY.FOR_EACH_TCF.RETRIEVE_TIME_CARD_FIELD_VALUE.$output?.items}}` where **DisplayValue** attribute matches with `{{$context.$variables.qTcfValue?.Value}}`"
