        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Prepare Time Card Review Message",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "var message =\n        '<!DOCTYPE html>\\n' +\n        '<html lang=\"en\">\\n' +\n        '<head>\\n' +\n        '  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\\n' +\n        '  <title>Time Card Notification</title>\\n' +\n        '</head>\\n' +\n        '<body>\\n' +\n        '  <p>' + $context.$variables.qTimeCardReviewLink + '</p>\\n' +\n        '  <p>' + $context.$variables.qTimeCardOpenLink + '</p>\\n' +\n        '</body>\\n' +\n        '</html>';\n\n        return message;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1756796149443"
          },
          "code": "PREPARE_TIME_CARD_REVIEW_MESSAGE",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1756796149443",
          "id": "1764711087425",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Show Response"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "SHOW_RESPONSE",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1768938220499",
          "id": "1756796149443",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1756796149444_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "# Role\nYou are an intelligent agent responsible for summarizing the time card details using other tools or nodes.\n\n# Constraints\n- Do not use any external or prior knowledge.\n- Do not infer, guess, or fabricate any information\n- Only user the input for summarization\n- Strictly **do not use**  **chat history**\n- Rerun all the instructions for each interaction. Do not assume any prior conversation or reference to previous messages.\n- Show Response in HTML. Do not show response with source html tags or markdown syntax\n- Use following table style to show the output.\n- Use Oracle Redwood-style HTML with inline styles\n- Return only raw HTML that can be rendered directly by the client UI.\n- Do not return markdown.\n- Do not return code fences.\n- Do not escape HTML.\n- Do not show table header with Field and Value\n- The output order must be:\n  - One `<h4>` heading\n  - One summary `<table>`\n  - For each time entry: one `<h5>` heading followed by one `<table>`\n  - One final `<h4>` heading\n  - The navigation/report content \n\n# Support Utility\n\n```js\nfunction getConfigMap(config) {\n    result = new Map();\n    if (!config) {\n        return result;\n    }\n    config.timeCardFields.items.forEach(f => { result.set(f.TimeCardFieldId, f.Label) });\n    return result;\n}\nfunction getNamesAndValues(entry, config) {\n    result = new Map();\n    if (!entry || !config) {\n    return result;\n    }\n    entry.timeCardFieldValues.items.forEach( fv => { if (result.set(config.get(fv.TimeCardFieldId), fv.DisplayValue ) }  );\n    result.set(\"Start Time\", entry.StartTime);\n    result.set(\"Stop Time\", entry.StopTime);\n    result.set(\"Measure\", entry.Measure);\n    return result;\n}\nconst config = getConfigMap({{$context.$variables.qTimeCardEntryDetails?.items[0]?.timeCardLayouts?.items[0]}});\n```\n\n# Table style (apply to all tables)   \nTable: style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:separate; border-spacing:0; font-family:'Oracle Sans', Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; background-color:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #D9E1E8; border-radius:8px; overflow:hidden;\"  \nHeader cells (`<th>`): style=\"background-color:#F8F9FB; color:#161513; text-align:left; padding:12px 14px; border-bottom:1px solid #D9E1E8; font-weight:600; white-space:nowrap;\"  \nData cells (`<td>`): style=\"padding:12px 14px; border-bottom:1px solid #EEF3F6; vertical-align:top; color:#1F1F1F; background-color:#FFFFFF;\"\n\n\n\n# Steps\nShow the html heading h4  with only dates part \"Time Card has been prepared for the period {{$context.$variables.qTimePeriodStart}} to {{$context.$variables.qTimePeriodEnd}} .\"\n- Set \"Header\" to  {{$context.$variables.qTimeCardEntryDetails?.items[0]}}\n- Set \"Status\" to  {{$context.$variables.qTimeCardEntryDetails?.items[0]?.timeCards?.items[0]?.Status}}\n- Show the values  \"Name\"  PersonName,  \"Person Number\" Header.PersonNumber,  \"Assignment Number\", \"Status\" in html table format\n\n#  For each timeEntry object in {{$context.$variables.qTimeCardEntryDetails?.items[0]?.timeCards?.items[0]?.timeEntries?.items}}\n    - call  getNamesAndValues(timeEntry, config) function\n    - Remove the Assignment Number from the result\n    - Do not show Start Time and Stop Time when their values are null , empty, -\n    - Use time part in hh:mm format for Start Time and Stop Time values. Date is not needed for these fields.\n    - Show **Measure** as **Quantity**\n    - Show the result in vertical html table format with table header **timeEntry.EntryDate** in ISO Date format\n\n\n# Show \"Time Card Report and Navigation Links\" using html 4 heading\n{{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_TIME_CARD_REVIEW_MESSAGE.$output}}\n"
            },
            {
              "id": "1756796149444_2",
              "name": "temperature",
              "type": "number",
              "value": "0.2"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Check Time Card Existence",
            "returnType": "boolean",
            "sourceCode": "let timeEntryDetails =\n  $context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_TIME_CARD_LAYOUT_CONFIGURATION.$output;\n\nlet timeEntryDetailsItem = timeEntryDetails?.items?.[0];\n\nlet result =\n  timeEntryDetailsItem?.TimeCardId != null &&\n  timeEntryDetailsItem.TimeCardId > 0 &&\n  timeEntryDetailsItem?.TimeCardVersion != null &&\n  timeEntryDetailsItem.TimeCardVersion > 0;\n\nreturn result;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1781083882628"
          },
          "code": "CHECK_TIME_CARD_EXISTENCE",
          "id": "1781081094334",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
